#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:231
msgid ""
"The <application>pluma</application> application enables you to create and "
"edit text files."
msgstr ""
"Lietotne <application>pluma</application> ļauj izveidot un rediģēt teksta "
"failus."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:232
msgid ""
"The aim of <application>pluma</application> is to be a simple and easy to "
"use text editor. More powerful features can be enabled with different "
"<firstterm>plugins</firstterm>, allowing a variety of tasks related to text-"
"editing."
msgstr ""
"<application>pluma</application> mērķis ir būt vienkāršam un viegli "
"lietojamam teksta redaktoram. Ar dažādiem <firstterm>spraudņiem</firstterm> "
"var iespējot jaudīgākas iespējas, kas ļauj veikt dažādus ar teksta "
"rediģēšanu saistītus uzdevumus."

