#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:365
msgid ""
"To create a new document, choose <menuchoice> <guimenu>File</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>. The application displays a new"
" blank document in the <application>pluma</application> window."
msgstr ""
"Lai izveidotu jaunu dokumentu, izvēlieties <menuchoice> <guimenu>Fails</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Jauns</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>. <application>pluma</"
"application> logā tiek parādīts jauns tukšs dokuments."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:371 C/index.docbook:2092
msgid "Opening a File"
msgstr "Faila atvēršana"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:373
msgid ""
"To open a file, choose <menuchoice> <guimenu>File</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Open</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> to display the <guilabel>Open "
"File</guilabel> dialog. Select the file that you want to open, then click "
"<guibutton>Open</guibutton>. The file is displayed in the "
"<application>pluma</application> window."
msgstr ""
"Lai atvērtu failu, izvēlieties <menuchoice> <guimenu>Fails</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Atvērt</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> — tiek parādīts "
"dialoglodziņš <guilabel>Atvērt failu</guilabel>. Atlasiet failu, kuru "
"vēlaties atvērt, un noklikšķiniet uz <guibutton>Atvērt</guibutton>. Fails "
"tiek parādīts <application>pluma</application> logā."

#. (itstool) path: textobject/phrase
#: C/index.docbook:379
msgid "Shows Recent Files menu icon."
msgstr "Nesen atvērto failu izvēlnes ikona."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:374
msgid ""
"The application records the paths and filenames of the five most recent "
"files that you edited and displays the files as menu items on the "
"<menuchoice> <guimenu>File</guimenu> </menuchoice> menu. You can also click "
"on the <_:inlinemediaobject-1/> icon on the toolbar to display the list of "
"recent files."
msgstr ""
"Lietotne atceras piecu pēdējo rediģēto failu ceļus un nosaukumus un parāda "
"tos kā vienumus izvēlnē <menuchoice> <guimenu>Fails</guimenu> </menuchoice>. "
"Nesen atvērto failu sarakstu var parādīt arī, noklikšķinot uz rīkjoslas "
"ikonas <_:inlinemediaobject-1/>."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/index.docbook:383
msgid ""
"You can open multiple files in <application>pluma</application>. The "
"application adds a tab for each open file to the window. For more on this "
"see <xref linkend=\"pluma-tabs\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Lietotnē <application>pluma</application> var atvērt vairākus failus. Katram "
"atvērtajam failam logā tiek pievienota cilne. Plašāku informāciju skatiet "
"<xref linkend=\"pluma-tabs\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: tip/para
#: C/index.docbook:386
msgid ""
"You can type the file location on <guilabel>Open File</guilabel> dialog. To "
"switch between location entry and breadcrumbs, press "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>l</keycap></keycombo>, "
"<keycap>.</keycap>, <keycap>~</keycap> or <keycap>/</keycap>."
msgstr ""
"Dialoglodziņā <guilabel>Atvērt failu</guilabel> var ievadīt faila atrašanās "
"vietu. Lai pārslēgtos starp atrašanās vietas lauku un ceļa pogām, nospiediet "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>l</keycap></keycombo>, <keycap>.</"
"keycap>, <keycap>~</keycap> vai <keycap>/</keycap>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:393
msgid "Saving a File"
msgstr "Faila saglabāšana"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:395
msgid "You can save files in the following ways:"
msgstr "Failus var saglabāt šādi:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:398
msgid ""
"To save changes to an existing file, choose <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Save</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Lai saglabātu izmaiņas esošā failā, izvēlieties <menuchoice> <guimenu>Fails</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Saglabāt</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:401
msgid ""
"To save a new file or to save an existing file under a new filename, choose "
"<menuchoice> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Save As</guimenuitem> "
"</menuchoice>. Enter a name for the file in the <guilabel>Save As</guilabel>"
