"nosaukumu, pēc tam noklikšķiniet uz <guibutton>Saglabāt</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:404
msgid ""
"To save all the files that are currently open in "
"<application>pluma</application>, choose <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>Documents</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Save All</guimenuitem> "
"</menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Lai saglabātu visus <application>pluma</application> pašlaik atvērtos "
"failus, izvēlieties <menuchoice> <guimenu>Dokumenti</guimenu> <guimenuitem>"
