#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:2412
msgid ""
"<literal>$(<replaceable>cmd</replaceable>)</literal> is replaced by the "
"result of executing <replaceable>cmd</replaceable> in a shell."
msgstr ""
