"<replaceable>a</replaceable> gives its order in the snippet. This allows you"
" to use python functions defined in another snippet. To specify several "
"dependencies, separate the numbers with commas thus: "
"<literal>$&lt;<replaceable>a</replaceable>,<replaceable>b</replaceable>:<replaceable>cmd</replaceable>&gt;</literal>"
msgstr ""
"<literal>$&lt;<replaceable>a</replaceable>:<replaceable>cmd</replaceable>"
"&gt;</literal> norāda citu Python vietturi kā atkarību, kur <replaceable>a</"
"replaceable> ir tā kārtas numurs fragmentā. Tā var izmantot citā fragmentā "
"definētas Python funkcijas. Lai norādītu vairākas atkarības, atdaliet "
"skaitļus ar komatiem: <literal>$&lt;<replaceable>a</replaceable>"
",<replaceable>b</replaceable>:<replaceable>cmd</replaceable>&gt;</literal>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:2421
msgid ""
